We insert one tweet into the priority queue.
- Time Complexity: O(log T)
- Auxiliary Space Complexity: O(1) per operation.
2. getNewsFeed()

Code:
priority_queue> cpy = pq;

First, we copy the entire priority queue.

- Copying priority queue takes O(T).

Then we traverse the copied priority queue:

while(!cpy.empty() && n < 10)

In the worst case, we may traverse all T tweets.

Each priority queue extraction takes O(log T).

Therefore:
- Copying priority queue: O(T)
- Extracting tweets: O(T log T)
- Checking follow relationship: O(1) average using unordered_set.
Total Time Complexity: O(T log T).

